<BaseLayout title="FM26 Staff and Coach Scouting | FM AI Assistent" description="Find and compare FM26 staff with filters, all nine coaching assignments and role-specific weighted ratings." path="/features/staff/">
  <div class="page-shell"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'Features',href:'/features/'},{label:'Staff analysis'}]} /><header class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">Backroom advantage</p><h1>Find and compare coaching staff.</h1><p class="lead">Search staff by job, club, division, ability, reputation, salary, contract and attributes, then evaluate their training assignments with role-specific ratings.</p></header>
    <section class="section feature-showcase"><div><h2>Compare the work they will actually do.</h2><p>The Coaching roles filter covers all nine documented assignments and lets you set a separate minimum star rating for each selected role.</p><ul class="check-list"><li>Filter job, club, division, salary and contract details</li><li>Set independent thresholds for coaching assignments</li><li>Inspect role-weighted attributes and a calculated 0–20 score</li><li>Compare full staff details by FM Unique ID</li></ul></div><figure class="screenshot-frame"><a href="/images/staff.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Open the staff database screenshot at full size"><img src="/images/staff.png" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" alt="FM AI Assistent staff table showing jobs, best coaching roles, star ratings and attributes" /></a><figcaption><span>The real staff table surfaces each person’s best training assignment.</span><a href="/images/staff.png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View full size ↗</a></figcaption></figure></section>
    <section class="section"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Transparent ratings</p><h2>Understand what the stars summarize.</h2></div><p>A staff detail view exposes the weighted attributes and calculated quality tier behind each assignment. This makes an assistant’s staff recommendation easier to check.</p></div><div class="comparison"><div class="local"><h3>Use the interface</h3><p>Filter candidates manually and inspect all role scores before approaching anyone in FM26.</p></div><div class="external"><h3>Use the assistant</h3><p>Ask for supported coaching keys and formulas, search a minimum star threshold, then compare the returned IDs.</p></div></div></section>
  </div><CallToAction eyebrow="Build the backroom" title="Search staff with role-level evidence." />
</BaseLayout>
